            "review_title": "Review at Uno Lounge Cafe",
            "review_text": "Iuliia T\n5 contributions\n0\nRestaurant with beautiful aorama views!\nJan 2025 • Friends\nRooftop cafe in downtown Nha Trang, sea and city views. We loved this place, it's cozy and quiet, the sunset view was amazing because the sun is setting behind the mountains. \nWe were with friends and had a great time, the food is delicious, we tried cheese sticks, sushi tempura (forgot the name), salad, cocktails and hookah.\n\nStaff speak English well\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten February 6, 2025",
